     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">\r\nHello,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Having done a pilot study last year, I prepared some methylation libraries using EM-Seq and decided to analyse my data using methylkit. I noticed no issues while doing the pilot study, as my sequencing data was quite small (around 6 million single-end\r\n reads per sample). However, for the full study, I got around 136 million paired-end reads per sample). </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>I have concerns regarding the number of CpGs I obtained using methylKit. It is known that there are 28 million CpGs in the human genome; however, the number of CpGs I got, especially at 1X and 3X coverage, suggests that the CpG counts may have been overestimated.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Please look at the snippets of my codes below and the results I got for each instance.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>N/B: I did the alignment and methylation extraction with Bismark, then imported the Coverage (.cov) or alignment output (.bam) files into methylkit.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>#Import and define the list containing the Bismark Coverage files</div>\r\n<div>OG8861 &lt;- list(</div>\r\n<div>  &quot;AAFJNNMM5-8861-04-00-01_S1_L001_R1_001_val_1_bismark_bt2_pe.bismark.cov.gz&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>  &quot;AAFJNNMM5-8861-05-00-01_S2_L001_R1_001_val_1_bismark_bt2_pe.bismark.cov.gz&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>  &quot;AAFJNNMM5-8861-06-00-01_S3_L001_R1_001_val_1_bismark_bt2_pe.bismark.cov.gz&quot;)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>COV_1 &lt;- methRead(OG8861,</div>\r\n<div>                  <a href=\"http://sample.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sample.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230500222000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xEuTsS5rMsLbYSBkS8PFp\">sample.id</a> = list(&quot;S1&quot;, &quot;S2&quot;, &quot;S3&quot;),</div>\r\n<div>                  pipeline = &quot;bismarkCoverage&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                  assembly = &quot;hg19&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                  treatment = c(0,0,1),</div>\r\n<div>                  context = &quot;CpG&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                  mincov = 1,</div>\r\n<div>                  dbtype = &quot;tabix”)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>I repeated this for 3X, 5X, and 10X coverage (codes not shown)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Result:</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-caps:normal;border-collapse:collapse;border:medium\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border:1pt solid windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> Sample<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span><u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 1x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 3x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 5x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 10x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> S1<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 48,841,280<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 29,043,575<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 12,581,307<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 650,604<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> S2<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 50,761,706<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 34,860,543<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 18,166,369<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 1,472,475<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> S3<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 44,959,784<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 21,303,364<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 7,247,631<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 265,220<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Concerned that the methylation_extraction operation may have been the cause of the implausible results obtained, I imported the bam files from Bismark directly into methylkit and then counted the CpGs. Please see my codes below:</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>#Sort the files</div>\r\n<div>bam_4 &lt;- BamFile(&quot;S4_pe.bam&quot;)</div>\r\n<div>reads &lt;- readGAlignments(bam_4)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div># Define input and output file paths</div>\r\n<div>input_bam_4 &lt;- &quot;S4_pe.bam&quot;</div>\r\n<div>output_bam_4 &lt;- “S4_sorted.bam&quot;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div># Sort the BAM files</div>\r\n<div>sortBam(input_bam_4, destination=output_bam_4)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>#Read the sorted files at 1X coverage. </div>\r\n<div>S4_1 &lt;- processBismarkAln(&quot;S4_sorted.bam.bam&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                          <a href=\"http://sample.id\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sample.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230500222000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0xEuTsS5rMsLbYSBkS8PFp\">sample.id</a>=&quot;S1_1&quot;, </div>\r\n<div>                          assembly = &quot;hg18&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                          save.folder = NULL,</div>\r\n<div>                          save.context = c(&quot;CpG&quot;),</div>\r\n<div>                          read.context=&quot;CpG&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                          nolap = FALSE,</div>\r\n<div>                          mincov = 1,</div>\r\n<div>                          minqual = 20,</div>\r\n<div>                          phred64 = FALSE,</div>\r\n<div>                          treatment = NULL,</div>\r\n<div>                          save.db = FALSE,</div>\r\n<div>                          verbose = 1)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I repeated this for all the samples at  3X, 5X, and 10X coverage (codes not shown)</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Result:</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-caps:normal;border-collapse:collapse;border:medium\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border:1pt solid windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> Sample<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span><u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 1x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 3x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 5x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 10x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> S1<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 49,783,470<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 31,603,367<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 16,688,990<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 1,992,364<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> S2<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 52,039,475<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 37,017,454<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 22,484,852<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 3,749,399<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> S3<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 45,501,338<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 26,431,339<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 13,237,981<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 1,623,263<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Although the second approach seems to give more reasonable results, I still have serious concerns about the accuracy of the CpG count at 1x, 3x, and 5x coverage.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Sorry about the long text; I wanted to provide as much relevant information as possible. I look forward to hearing from you soon. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Thank you. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Kind regards,</div>\r\n<div>Mark.</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "j6opy2-bBgAJ",
   "from": "Alexander Blume",
   "author": "a413e6cf6c4ea2cc",
   "date": "2024-05-06T11:56:36Z",
   "subject": "Re: Query: CpG counts",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Hello Mark,</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Thanks for your detailed question. Your code and approach seem correct. Also, it is true that there are 28 million CpGs in the human genome. However, the number of sites observed is approximately double the real number because many sites cover the same CpG-dinucleotide from both strands. Most sites with only 1bp distance very likely belong to the same CpG-dinucleotide. The problem is that the Bismark coverage files do not contain any strand information, so this could be misleading downstream. But using the Bismark BAM  or cytosine report files will retain strand information and allow &quot;destranding&quot; during the unite step, i.e. merging of sites that belong the same CpG-dinucleotide.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif\">I hope this explanation helps to resolve your problem. </div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Best,</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:small;font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Alex</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">Mark Ezegbogu schrieb am Sonntag, 5. Mai 2024 um 09:57:20 UTC+2:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">\r\nHello,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Having done a pilot study last year, I prepared some methylation libraries using EM-Seq and decided to analyse my data using methylkit. I noticed no issues while doing the pilot study, as my sequencing data was quite small (around 6 million single-end\r\n reads per sample). However, for the full study, I got around 136 million paired-end reads per sample). </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>I have concerns regarding the number of CpGs I obtained using methylKit. It is known that there are 28 million CpGs in the human genome; however, the number of CpGs I got, especially at 1X and 3X coverage, suggests that the CpG counts may have been overestimated.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Please look at the snippets of my codes below and the results I got for each instance.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>N/B: I did the alignment and methylation extraction with Bismark, then imported the Coverage (.cov) or alignment output (.bam) files into methylkit.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>#Import and define the list containing the Bismark Coverage files</div>\r\n<div>OG8861 &lt;- list(</div>\r\n<div>  &quot;AAFJNNMM5-8861-04-00-01_S1_L001_R1_001_val_1_bismark_bt2_pe.bismark.cov.gz&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>  &quot;AAFJNNMM5-8861-05-00-01_S2_L001_R1_001_val_1_bismark_bt2_pe.bismark.cov.gz&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>  &quot;AAFJNNMM5-8861-06-00-01_S3_L001_R1_001_val_1_bismark_bt2_pe.bismark.cov.gz&quot;)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>COV_1 &lt;- methRead(OG8861,</div>\r\n<div>                  <a href=\"http://sample.id\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sample.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230500226000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2T9eYqoGX3d-KsHd5ZiPAS\">sample.id</a> = list(&quot;S1&quot;, &quot;S2&quot;, &quot;S3&quot;),</div>\r\n<div>                  pipeline = &quot;bismarkCoverage&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                  assembly = &quot;hg19&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                  treatment = c(0,0,1),</div>\r\n<div>                  context = &quot;CpG&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                  mincov = 1,</div>\r\n<div>                  dbtype = &quot;tabix”)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>I repeated this for 3X, 5X, and 10X coverage (codes not shown)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Result:</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-caps:normal;border-collapse:collapse;border:medium\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border:1pt solid windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> Sample<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span><u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 1x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 3x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 5x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 10x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> S1<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 48,841,280<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 29,043,575<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 12,581,307<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 650,604<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> S2<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 50,761,706<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 34,860,543<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 18,166,369<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 1,472,475<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> S3<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 44,959,784<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 21,303,364<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 7,247,631<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 265,220<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Concerned that the methylation_extraction operation may have been the cause of the implausible results obtained, I imported the bam files from Bismark directly into methylkit and then counted the CpGs. Please see my codes below:</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>#Sort the files</div>\r\n<div>bam_4 &lt;- BamFile(&quot;S4_pe.bam&quot;)</div>\r\n<div>reads &lt;- readGAlignments(bam_4)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div># Define input and output file paths</div>\r\n<div>input_bam_4 &lt;- &quot;S4_pe.bam&quot;</div>\r\n<div>output_bam_4 &lt;- “S4_sorted.bam&quot;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div># Sort the BAM files</div>\r\n<div>sortBam(input_bam_4, destination=output_bam_4)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>#Read the sorted files at 1X coverage. </div>\r\n<div>S4_1 &lt;- processBismarkAln(&quot;S4_sorted.bam.bam&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                          <a href=\"http://sample.id\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://sample.id&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230500226000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2T9eYqoGX3d-KsHd5ZiPAS\">sample.id</a>=&quot;S1_1&quot;, </div>\r\n<div>                          assembly = &quot;hg18&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                          save.folder = NULL,</div>\r\n<div>                          save.context = c(&quot;CpG&quot;),</div>\r\n<div>                          read.context=&quot;CpG&quot;,</div>\r\n<div>                          nolap = FALSE,</div>\r\n<div>                          mincov = 1,</div>\r\n<div>                          minqual = 20,</div>\r\n<div>                          phred64 = FALSE,</div>\r\n<div>                          treatment = NULL,</div>\r\n<div>                          save.db = FALSE,</div>\r\n<div>                          verbose = 1)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I repeated this for all the samples at  3X, 5X, and 10X coverage (codes not shown)</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Result:</span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-variant-caps:normal;border-collapse:collapse;border:medium\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border:1pt solid windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> Sample<span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span><u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 1x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 3x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 5x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:1pt 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:solid solid solid none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 10x coverage<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt;border-style:none solid solid;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> S1<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 49,783,470<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 31,603,367<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.15pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 16,688,990<u></u></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"120\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:90.2pt;border-width:medium 1pt 1pt medium;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:currentcolor windowtext windowtext currentcolor;padding:0in 5.4pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0in;line-height:normal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">\r\n<u></u> 1,992